# Canonical replay (HUD test)

For **sports commentary**, **HUD extraction**, **local VO**, and **reel** experiments on this machine, always start from:

| Field | Value |
|-------|--------|
| Media | `data/media/imports/2026-08-21-rec2k-merged.mkv` (burned-in HUD overlays) |
| Session | `3ba5532d-3812-4868-82e7-9053c90bbf12` |
| Config | `config/canonical-replay.json` |

Before encode / analysis / VO / short render:

1. `npx tsx scripts/ensure-canonical-replay.ts` — re-attaches media if the session drifted.
2. `npx tsx scripts/generate-local-commentary.ts` — defaults to the canonical session (no `--session-id` required).

Do not substitute other replay files unless the user explicitly asks.
